{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>專為嬰幼兒而設的睡眠輔助應用，內置多種現成安眠聲音，包括白噪音、搖籃曲、柔和雨聲與海浪聲，讓寶寶更容易入睡。應用同時提供聲音混音與睡前故事功能，協助家長建立平靜順暢的睡前流程，特別適合需要哄睡的初生至幼兒家庭。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂專屬安睡音景</h2>\n<p>應用收錄白噪音、搖籃曲、柔和雨聲及海浪聲等預設安眠聲音，家長可按寶寶當下的反應直接選用。聲音混音功能讓用家自由混合不同音效，調配出最合適的入睡氛圍。內置睡前故事則以輕柔語調陪伴孩子入眠，令整個哄睡過程更順暢，減少反覆安撫的時間。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-750-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-751-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-752-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-753-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-754-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-755-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Baby Feed &amp; Sleep Tracker</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T21:38:44.318997+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":316,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}